    <p><code>getClaimResolveState</code> now derives the earliest possible <code>SnapshotSent</code> block from <code>(E+1)P</code> on the Inbox provider, scans the Inbox in chunks to its own head, and chooses the newest event. It reads the Outbox claim hash at an explicit head block. This repairs the old use of an Outbox-derived lower bound against an Inbox contract.</p>
